{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d221b74f-ca80-8ab4-8137-ac31608b1588",
  "created_at": "2026-02-05T12:23:23-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nicholas DeLuca",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:20:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:20:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin. Well, I'm calling because my trash can is still sitting full and the truck's apparently gone on vacation without me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:20:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let's see what we can do. Which address are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:20:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "368 Ocean Avenue. Out on the Ocean Drive side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:20:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "368 Ocean Avenue, got it. And what's your usual pickup day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:20:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday. Today. But I put it out last night like always, and I just looked, and it's still there, and the street's already been done, I think. The neighbor's bins are empty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:21:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it was not picked up on the usual day, or at least not yet. Did you put it out before the truck normally comes through?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:21:19-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh yeah, it's been out since seven last night. [pause] Sorry, I'm on speakerphone, I'm trying to keep my voice down. I'm an aide at a daycare and the kids are napping right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:21:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. Take your time. Is it just the trash, or the recycling too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:21:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the trash. The recycling's not till next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:21:44-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm writing this down. Three sixty-eight Ocean Avenue, Thursday trash, not collected, bin was out by last evening. Anything blocking the bin, like a car parked close or snow bank in front of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:21:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it's right at the end of the driveway, clear as can be. Nothing in front of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:22:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Then I'll send this over to the collection crew and they can see if they missed it or ran late. Sometimes the routes run behind and they get to the Ocean Drive end later in the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:22:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be. [line breaks up] Is there a fee for them coming back for it? I don't want a surprise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:22:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, a missed pickup is not something you get charged for. If it's on us, it's on us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:22:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That's what I figured, but I wanted to ask."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:22:37-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Smart to ask. So here's what I'd do. Leave the bin where it is, and if the truck hasn't come by end of the day, give us a call back or I can have somebody call you. Is the number on the account the best one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:22:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Use 401-555-0184. That's the cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:22:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-four. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:23:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:23:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, Mr. DeLuca, it's in. Somebody should either pick it up this afternoon or get back to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:23:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks Kevin. I'll leave it out there. I've got to get back to the little ones before they wake up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:23:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Enjoy the rest of your Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-05T12:23:21-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
